    {
      "id": "u_2c976771c0935c9b79671e27_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A heading can be collapsed to hide the content under it, up to the next heading of the same or a higher level. A lower heading is hidden along with the rest, and keeps its own state.",
      "sourceHash": "2c976771c0935c9b79671e2744365b7bcbba31cec2f15af5d616840bdd50033d",
      "context": "Collapsible headings",
      "contextHash": "1868c9dd6a51f01df6281a42ef89b084c2d0a2b0622cc79a00df71e07470bcff",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_38ebfb2b6ce589ce249b9609_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Collapsing and expanding__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "38ebfb2b6ce589ce249b9609d3f3d2b5616ead3d6773a769f0528aa726575e30",
      "context": "Collapsible headings > Collapsing and expanding",
      "contextHash": "f587adba0f0ff264b67b5c50876866573e730a19d2970be96e41ba7e566b6127",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_95a00745ee1208d94fe921d6_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To collapse or expand a heading, click the arrow at the end of the heading. The arrow appears while the mouse is over the heading or the cursor is in it, and stays visible while the heading is collapsed.",
      "sourceHash": "95a00745ee1208d94fe921d62bfdf8372f124ecea341a5a8759cbb21470c2b90",
      "context": "Collapsible headings > Collapsing and expanding",
      "contextHash": "f587adba0f0ff264b67b5c50876866573e730a19d2970be96e41ba7e566b6127",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_eda9f5a181d8979aee6aeef5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To use the keyboard instead, place the cursor in the heading and press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__Alt__TRILIUM_PH_3__+__TRILIUM_PH_4__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "eda9f5a181d8979aee6aeef562fb7efc0dac1e70b1bf578893235d20694d361b",
      "context": "Collapsible headings > Collapsing and expanding",
      "contextHash": "f587adba0f0ff264b67b5c50876866573e730a19d2970be96e41ba7e566b6127",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ea64b7b0ea44f34e6ee584f1_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The menu of the drag handle beside a heading also offers __TRILIUM_PH_0__Collapse section__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and __TRILIUM_PH_2__Expand section__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "ea64b7b0ea44f34e6ee584f130fa5558ab5147b2e63b755b91e3be7b3320e825",
      "context": "Collapsible headings > Collapsing and expanding",
      "contextHash": "f587adba0f0ff264b67b5c50876866573e730a19d2970be96e41ba7e566b6127",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d5e78ca5973874af0ceafb91_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The collapsed state is saved with the note, so a heading stays collapsed when the note is opened again.",
      "sourceHash": "d5e78ca5973874af0ceafb9199acd4c740f5e4444b162c01349f912454d38d5c",
      "context": "Collapsible headings > Collapsing and expanding",
      "contextHash": "f587adba0f0ff264b67b5c50876866573e730a19d2970be96e41ba7e566b6127",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9cc68595651c36414015698a_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Editing around a collapsed heading__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "9cc68595651c36414015698ad0b6512d17b1b156ee0e162bd7eebf2284956c03",
      "context": "Collapsible headings > Editing around a collapsed heading",
      "contextHash": "2537ef5cedb0f45dd6666584bf77918224a683890b73705aff4f6553e91bce62",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c83def0a76ccca12d5d63e10_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Pressing __TRILIUM_PH_0__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_1__ at the end of a collapsed heading adds a new heading of the same level below the hidden content.",
      "sourceHash": "c83def0a76ccca12d5d63e10ed6c11d8ba72e7e7bb6cc7b29aea9451991d3bd1",
      "context": "Collapsible headings > Editing around a collapsed heading",
      "contextHash": "2537ef5cedb0f45dd6666584bf77918224a683890b73705aff4f6553e91bce62",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e2c8227b648c56a39b60052f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The arrow keys move the cursor past the hidden content.",
      "sourceHash": "e2c8227b648c56a39b60052f14d21189ecb567bd986fa652122aee671f506573",
      "context": "Collapsible headings > Editing around a collapsed heading",
      "contextHash": "2537ef5cedb0f45dd6666584bf77918224a683890b73705aff4f6553e91bce62",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0191ea72511ec7c42290e6b4_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Backspace__TRILIUM_PH_1__ right below a collapsed heading's content, or __TRILIUM_PH_2__Delete__TRILIUM_PH_3__ at the end of a collapsed heading, expands the heading instead of deleting the hidden content. If the line right below the hidden content is empty, either key deletes that empty line instead.",
      "sourceHash": "0191ea72511ec7c42290e6b4b68365d727b1583604897802dfa21a5d0c2d053b",
      "context": "Collapsible headings > Editing around a collapsed heading",
      "contextHash": "2537ef5cedb0f45dd6666584bf77918224a683890b73705aff4f6553e91bce62",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b3df16c016f426f359305520_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Dragging a collapsed heading by its drag handle moves its hidden content along with it.",
      "sourceHash": "b3df16c016f426f3593055202e75a16695a3c5a0489ce56d450db10481eb83b3",
      "context": "Collapsible headings > Editing around a collapsed heading",
      "contextHash": "2537ef5cedb0f45dd6666584bf77918224a683890b73705aff4f6553e91bce62",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4b4d3a54bd86ee65ae33ab8e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A collapsed heading expands when content is added to its section, for example by pasting or by dropping a block under it.",
      "sourceHash": "4b4d3a54bd86ee65ae33ab8eb96aa2df412bcfad50f9334ef9eefe821bcb5d5f",
      "context": "Collapsible headings > Editing around a collapsed heading",
      "contextHash": "2537ef5cedb0f45dd6666584bf77918224a683890b73705aff4f6553e91bce62",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8707e436134aeddf584b6ddd_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Search in note__TRILIUM_PH_1__, the table of contents and links to a block show hidden content when they lead to it, without expanding the heading.",
      "sourceHash": "8707e436134aeddf584b6ddd8165fcd8946b0d61e13446c8f6703390d0f12dc8",
      "context": "Collapsible headings > Editing around a collapsed heading",
      "contextHash": "2537ef5cedb0f45dd6666584bf77918224a683890b73705aff4f6553e91bce62",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ba826ba81da0893d072c34bc_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Read-only notes__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "ba826ba81da0893d072c34bca5bb5b3fc6451a529bf301d945bd38a41214338c",
      "context": "Collapsible headings > Read-only notes",
      "contextHash": "a66380887471c9e1fa608f93a2b838111b4e28eb195c249da9f785012ae97e22",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4c2ebd38f024a9a55430ec6f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The arrow also works in notes shown read-only (see __TRILIUM_PH_0__Read-Only Notes__TRILIUM_PH_1__), but there the changes are not saved: the note shows its saved state again when it is reopened.",
      "sourceHash": "4c2ebd38f024a9a55430ec6ffbca326fa4642d706ca260b38983e3fa8234da1c",
      "context": "Collapsible headings > Read-only notes",
      "contextHash": "a66380887471c9e1fa608f93a2b838111b4e28eb195c249da9f785012ae97e22",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e206fca9fc41ccbdf19e5283_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To use the keyboard there, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Tab__TRILIUM_PH_1__ to move to a heading that has content under it, then __TRILIUM_PH_2__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_3__ or __TRILIUM_PH_4__Space__TRILIUM_PH_5__ to collapse or expand it.",
      "sourceHash": "e206fca9fc41ccbdf19e5283e23a0c3e05bfa4f929887f4b27502fde0c773fa1",
      "context": "Collapsible headings > Read-only notes",
      "contextHash": "a66380887471c9e1fa608f93a2b838111b4e28eb195c249da9f785012ae97e22",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
